import{_ as t,o,c as n,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 721 | Transcended-Ones' Perpetual-Construction System · Overview — the stronger, the more you must work","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 721 | Transcended-Ones' Perpetual-Construction System · Overview — the stronger, the more you must work","no":721,"module":4,"tags":["Perpetual Construction","Overview","Stronger-Work-More","Positive-Feedback Cycle","Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm"],"related":["06-More-Work-More-Gain Allocation Principle","17-Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards","25-Symbiotic Feedback-Cycle Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0721_模块4-永动建设总论.md","filePath":"en/0721_模块4-永动建设总论.md"}`),a={name:"en/0721_模块4-永动建设总论.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,u,h){return o(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i(`<h1 id="entry-721-transcended-ones-perpetual-construction-system-·-overview-—-the-stronger-the-more-you-must-work" tabindex="-1">Entry 721 | Transcended-Ones&#39; Perpetual-Construction System · Overview — the stronger, the more you must work <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-721-transcended-ones-perpetual-construction-system-·-overview-—-the-stronger-the-more-you-must-work" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 721 | Transcended-Ones&#39; Perpetual-Construction System · Overview — the stronger, the more you must work&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 06, 17, 25</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-old-web-novels-endpoint-is-heng-yuan-zhou-s-starting-point" tabindex="-1">Introduction: old web novels&#39; endpoint is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s starting point <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-old-web-novels-endpoint-is-heng-yuan-zhou-s-starting-point" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: old web novels&#39; endpoint is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s starting point&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Old web novels&#39; cultivation endpoint is the antonym of &quot;work&quot;: invincible, immortal, free, undisturbed. After the protagonist punches through everything, his greatest wish is &quot;never have to fight again.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou completely erases this wish from its legal definition — <strong>in Heng Yuan Zhou, the cultivation endpoint is work&#39;s beginning.</strong> The stronger you are, the more work you must do; the more work you do, the stronger you become; the stronger you become, the more work you must do. This is the &quot;perpetual-construction system.&quot;</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry converge into the word &quot;cycle&quot;: the anti-predation axiom requires this cycle be driven by creating increments, not plundering stock; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the cycle&#39;s output serve Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom is the cycle&#39;s direction; the causal self-discipline axiom is the cycle&#39;s procedural guarantee; the law-first axiom requires &quot;the stronger, the more you work&quot; itself be a law-level definition, not modifiable by any protagonist&#39;s will.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-the-old-system-s-endpoint-fantasy-collapses" tabindex="-1">I. Why the old system&#39;s &quot;endpoint fantasy&quot; collapses <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-the-old-system-s-endpoint-fantasy-collapses" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why the old system&#39;s &quot;endpoint fantasy&quot; collapses&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Old web novels&#39; endpoint fantasy rests on three wrong assumptions:</p><ol><li><strong>Power is private property</strong>: once you reach the top, the power is yours; use it however you like; if you don&#39;t want to use it, you don&#39;t;</li><li><strong>Society is static</strong>: after you retire, the world keeps running as before, not needing you;</li><li><strong>Time is irrelevant</strong>: whether you live a million years or one year makes no difference to the world.</li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou overturns all three:</p><ol><li>Power is not private property; it comes from the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle; you are only a temporary bearer;</li><li>Society is not static; every moment it needs living anchors on-site maintaining the law network;</li><li>Time is not irrelevant; whether you are on post directly determines the law network&#39;s stability.</li></ol><p>The three overthrows together are &quot;the stronger, the more you must work.&quot; This is not moral kidnapping; this is cosmological fact.</p><h2 id="ii-the-positive-feedback-cycle-of-perpetual-construction" tabindex="-1">II. The Positive-Feedback Cycle of Perpetual Construction <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-positive-feedback-cycle-of-perpetual-construction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Positive-Feedback Cycle of Perpetual Construction&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The perpetual-construction system&#39;s core is a <strong>positive-feedback cycle that spins faster and faster</strong>:</p><div class="language- vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang"></span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span>work → law-weaving experience grows → per-unit-time output rises → civilizational weight rises</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  ↑                                                                  ↓</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  ←──────── larger public computable power to dispatch ←────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Every link in this cycle is natural law, not moral preaching:</p><ul><li>You work; your consciousness&#39;s fusion with the law network deepens one layer; your understanding of laws grows one point;</li><li>Understanding grows one point; per-unit-time work you may do grows one point;</li><li>More work done; Myriad Ranks recognize your contribution; your civilizational weight rises;</li><li>Weight rises; the law network&#39;s public computable power you may dispatch grows;</li><li>Larger computable power; more work you may do.</li></ul><p>Once the cycle spins, it accelerates itself. This is the physical meaning of &quot;perpetual motion&quot; — <strong>not maintained by willpower, but maintained by the laws&#39; own self-acceleration.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-why-this-cycle-does-not-burn-you-out" tabindex="-1">III. Why this cycle does not &quot;burn you out&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-this-cycle-does-not-burn-you-out" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why this cycle does not &quot;burn you out&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Some may ask: the stronger, the more you work; won&#39;t transcended ones burn out?</p><p>No. Two reasons:</p><h3 id="_3-1-work-efficiency-rises-exponentially-with-realm" tabindex="-1">3.1 Work efficiency rises exponentially with realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-1-work-efficiency-rises-exponentially-with-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.1 Work efficiency rises exponentially with realm&quot;">​</a></h3><p>In the mortal-cultivation stage, what one person can do in a day is limited; by the Origin Realm, his consciousness may simultaneously handle multiple planes&#39; affairs; by the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, his consciousness diffuses in the law network, and &quot;working&quot; and &quot;existing&quot; have already merged. He is not &quot;consuming himself&quot;; he is <strong>doing work through existence itself.</strong></p><h3 id="_3-2-rest-is-part-of-the-cycle" tabindex="-1">3.2 Rest is part of the cycle <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-2-rest-is-part-of-the-cycle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.2 Rest is part of the cycle&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Perpetual motion is not 24-hour no-rest. It is cyclic: high-intensity construction period → calibration-reflection period → reconstruction period. The calibration-reflection period is not lying flat; it is consciousness-domain-level law-calibration work — during this period the transcended one organizes experience, distills new methods, prepares for the next stage of construction.</p><h2 id="iv-perpetual-construction-s-opposition-to-lie-flat-flee-and-monopolize" tabindex="-1">IV. Perpetual Construction&#39;s Opposition to Lie-Flat, Flee, and Monopolize <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-perpetual-construction-s-opposition-to-lie-flat-flee-and-monopolize" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Perpetual Construction&#39;s Opposition to Lie-Flat, Flee, and Monopolize&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The perpetual-construction system is the positive alternative to old web novels&#39; three pseudo-transcendences:</p><ul><li>To flee-style transcendence: you run; the cycle breaks; you stay; the cycle spins;</li><li>To lie-flat-style transcendence: you lie down; the cycle stops; you rise; the cycle spins;</li><li>To monopolize-style transcendence: you hide experience; the cycle has no external input; you make it public; the cycle has new material.</li></ul><p>Therefore the perpetual-construction system is not merely &quot;work&quot;; it is the collective name for <strong>stringing the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle, the nine posts, the Selfless-Dao public library, and civilizational weight all into one self-accelerating system.</strong></p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: perpetual construction directs every unit of strong-one computable power into the positive-feedback cycle, preventing any form of computable-power idling</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the cycle is driven by creating increments, not plundering stock; those with improper origins cannot enter the cycle</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style strong ones reach the summit as endpoint; Heng Yuan Zhou-style strong ones reach the summit as on-post — a complete flip of endpoint and starting point</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the cycle&#39;s output is open to 99% of clans through the Selfless Dao; it is not an internal cycle of a strong-one club</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: every link of the cycle — work experience, weight algorithm, public computable-power allocation — is all public on the Selfless Dao</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The stronger, the more you must work. These six characters are Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s most counterintuitive, also most core, definition of &quot;transcendence.&quot; It is unromantic, unpoetic, unsuitable for being written into a爽文 line, but it is the only law that lets Heng Yuan Zhou keep &quot;perpetually&quot; going.</p><p>Old web-novel protagonists go offline after beating the final boss, and the reader&#39;s rush ends with it. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended ones, after beating the final boss, do not go offline but go on post — he walks into the nine posts&#39; office and takes over the next stage of civilizational engineering. If the reader applies the web-novel paradigm to Heng Yuan Zhou, he will think &quot;why hasn&#39;t this protagonist gotten off work yet?&quot; But precisely this &quot;not getting off work&quot; lets the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle always have living water, lets Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cosmos always be growing. You want to be completely invincible? Fine; then work all your life; the more you work, the more invincible you are. This is all of perpetual construction.</p><p>In the end, the perpetual-construction overview described in this entry is no isolated case — its causal and energetic traces are throughout filed in the Alaya Network, traceable and correctable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/06-多劳多得分配原理.html">Entry 06 · More-Work-More-Gain Allocation Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic Feedback-Cycle Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/22-资源分配联产承包机制.html">Entry 22 · Resource-Allocation Joint-Contracting Mechanism</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>`,37)])])}const y=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{d as __pageData,y as default};
